.SH NAME
git-bug-bug-review - List reviews on a pull-request


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit-bug bug review [BUG_ID] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List each review on the given pull-request, with its verdict, body, and line-anchored review comments.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for review


